          <h1>Mission Directives</h1>
          <p class="landing-hero__lead"><strong>Bounded, reviewable, and verifiable agent work.</strong> A curated library of advanced prompts and deterministic orchestration tools that resolves natural-language intent to the smallest coherent workflow needed for the outcome.</p>
          <div class="landing-hero__actions">
